{"seq":1,"slug":"electrochemistry-fundamentals","title":"电化学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/electrochemistry-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"electrode-reactions-thermodynamics","title":"电极反应与电池热力学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/electrochemistry-fundamentals/electrode-reactions-thermodynamics","wordCount":2217,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"battery-kinetics-transport","title":"电池动力学与传输过程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/electrochemistry-fundamentals/battery-kinetics-transport","wordCount":2390,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-parameters-testing","title":"性能参数与测试方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/electrochemistry-fundamentals/performance-parameters-testing","wordCount":2205,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"电化学基础\">电化学基础</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>电池的本质是可控的电化学氧化还原反应。本章从电极反应的热力学与动力学出发，建立对电池工作原理的物理化学认知，并定义贯穿后续章节的核心性能参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序号</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>电极反应与电池热力学</td>\n<td>Nernst方程、标准电极电位、开路电压、吉布斯自由能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>电池动力学与传输</td>\n<td>Butler-Volmer方程、极化曲线、离子扩散、SEI膜形成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>性能参数与测试方法</td>\n<td>能量密度/功率密度/循环寿命/库伦效率/倍率性能/EIS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>能量密度（Energy Density）</strong>：单位质量或体积储存的能量（Wh/kg 或 Wh/L）</li>\n<li><strong>Nernst 方程</strong>：描述电极电位与反应物浓度关系的基本方程</li>\n<li><strong>SEI（Solid Electrolyte Interface）</strong>：负极表面形成的固态电解质界面膜</li>\n</ul>\n"}